{
  "version": "v3.15.186",
  "date": "2026-07-31",
  "body": "### New features/UI/Updates\n\n- #4453 Enhance SSH tunnel form to display local and remote address dynamically\n- Add a separate SFTP channel for responsive file transfers and manage its lifecycle\n- Add close sequence and delay options for serial connections, support graceful exit\n- Support drag-and-drop reorder with directional indicators, now can drag to last position\n- Implement write coalescing and buffer management for terminal output\n- Mobile: Support long press terminal to show context menu\n- UI: Enhance file size display in file compare modal with byte count\n- Support code compare when select two files\n- Support terminal wrap toggle\n- UI: Improve terminal control toolbar UI in mobile mode\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- #4453 Fix default SSH tunnel value to 'forwardLocalToRemote'\n- Fix disk info check command in terminal info component\n- Fix responsive mode can not drag app issue\n- Fix previous search function in terminal search panel\n- UI: Fix fullscreen mode mobile UI\n- Restore Alt/Option+arrow word-move behavior lost in xterm 6.x (#4449) by @forever765\n- Fix use proxy sync data cause error issue (#4448)\n- Validate dispatched method names in dispatch-center and fs (#4447) by @arpitjain099\n- Mobile: Adjust input font size to prevent zoom issues\n- UI: Fix buttons UI when no session\n\n-----\n\n### 新功能/界面/更新\n\n- #4453 增强 SSH 隧道表单，动态显示本地和远程地址信息\n- 为响应式文件传输实现独立的 SFTP 通道并管理其生命周期\n- 为串口连接添加关闭序列和延迟选项，支持优雅退出\n- 支持拖放重排序并显示方向指示，现在可以拖到最后一个位置\n- 实现终端输出的写入合并与缓冲管理\n- 移动端：支持长按终端显示上下文菜单\n- 界面：在文件对比弹窗中增强文件大小显示，增加字节数\n- 支持选择两个文件时进行代码对比\n- 支持终端换行开关\n- 界面：优化移动端终端控制工具栏 UI\n\n### Bug 修复\n\n- #4453 修复 SSH 隧道默认值，改为 'forwardLocalToRemote'\n- 修复终端信息组件中的磁盘信息检查命令\n- 修复响应式模式下无法拖动应用的问题\n- 修复终端搜索面板中上一次搜索功能的问题\n- 界面：修复移动端全屏模式 UI\n- 恢复 xterm 6.x 中丢失的 Alt/Option+方向键 单词跳转行为 (#4449)（由 @forever765 提供）\n- 修复使用代理同步数据导致错误的问题 (#4448)\n- 校验 dispatch-center 与 fs 中派发的方法名 (#4447)（由 @arpitjain099 提供）\n- 移动端：调整输入框字体大小以防止页面缩放\n- 界面：修复无会话时的按钮 UI\n\n-------\n\nDownload下载: [https://electerm.org](https://electerm.org)\n",
